---
// Side-by-side Go code trace vs animated runtime execution flow for sub-slice append aliasing.
const W = 900;
const H = 350;
---
<figure class="gmct">
  <div class="gmct-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Side-by-side code trace matching Go sub-slice slicing and append lines on the left to animated heap backing-array mutation flow on the right.">
      {/* Left panel: Go code trace */}
      <rect x="14" y="16" width="386" height="316" rx="10" class="gmct-panel" />
      <text x="30" y="42" class="gmct-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Go code (line-by-line execution)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Code Go (chạy từng dòng)</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="26" y="56" width="362" height="44" rx="6" class="gmct-line-box" />
      <text x="36" y="74" class="gmct-num">L1</text>
      <text x="60" y="74" class="gmct-code">s1 := []int{'{'}10, 20, 30, 40, 50{'}'}</text>
      <text x="60" y="92" class="gmct-sm">len=5, cap=5 (allocs array[5])</text>

      <rect x="26" y="108" width="362" height="44" rx="6" class="gmct-line-box is-warn" />
      <text x="36" y="126" class="gmct-num-warn">L2</text>
      <text x="60" y="126" class="gmct-code">s2 := s1[1:3]       // ptr=&amp;arr[1]</text>
      <text x="60" y="144" class="gmct-warn">len=2, cap=4 (shares [3], [4]!)</text>

      <rect x="26" y="160" width="362" height="44" rx="6" class="gmct-line-box is-red" />
      <text x="36" y="178" class="gmct-num-red">L3</text>
      <text x="60" y="178" class="gmct-code-red">s2 = append(s2, 99) // 2 &lt; cap 4</text>
      <text x="60" y="196" class="gmct-red">writes 99 directly to arr[3]!</text>

      <rect x="26" y="212" width="362" height="44" rx="6" class="gmct-line-box is-red" />
      <text x="36" y="230" class="gmct-num-red">L4</text>
      <text x="60" y="230" class="gmct-code">fmt.Println(s1[3])  // prints 99</text>
      <text x="60" y="248" class="gmct-sm">expected 40, corrupted by s2 append</text>

      <rect x="26" y="268" width="362" height="48" rx="6" class="gmct-line-box is-ok" />
      <text x="38" y="288" class="gmct-ok">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Fix: s2 := s1[1:3:3]  (full slice cap=2)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Cách sửa: s2 := s1[1:3:3]  (khóa cap=2)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="38" y="306" class="gmct-sm">
        <tspan data-lang-en>append allocates a fresh backing array</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>append buộc cấp mảng mới cho s2</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Connector lines L1..L4 -> Steps 1..4 */}
      <path d="M 388 78 L 452 78" class="gmct-wire" />
      <path d="M 388 130 L 452 138" class="gmct-wire is-warn" />
      <path d="M 388 182 L 452 198" class="gmct-wire is-red" />
      <path d="M 388 234 L 452 258" class="gmct-wire is-red" />

      {/* Right panel: Runtime flow */}
      <rect x="454" y="16" width="432" height="316" rx="10" class="gmct-panel" />
      <text x="470" y="42" class="gmct-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Runtime &amp; heap flow (what actually runs)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Luồng chạy trên Heap (bên dưới runtime)</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="468" y="56" width="380" height="50" rx="6" class="gmct-step" />
      <text x="480" y="77" class="gmct-b">① L1: Alloc arr = [10, 20, 30, 40, 50]</text>
      <text x="480" y="96" class="gmct-sm">
        <tspan data-lang-en>s1.ptr = &amp;arr[0] · whole 5 slots active</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>s1.ptr = &amp;arr[0] · đủ 5 phần tử ban đầu</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="468" y="116" width="380" height="50" rx="6" class="gmct-step is-warn" />
      <text x="480" y="137" class="gmct-warn">② L2: Slice header shares arr[1..4]</text>
      <text x="480" y="156" class="gmct-sm">
        <tspan data-lang-en>No allocation! s2.cap = 4 reaches arr[4]</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Không cấp mới! s2.cap = 4 chạm tới arr[4]</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="468" y="176" width="380" height="50" rx="6" class="gmct-step is-red" />
      <text x="480" y="197" class="gmct-red">③ L3: len(2) &lt; cap(4) → writes arr[3] = 99</text>
      <text x="480" y="216" class="gmct-sm">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Go sees spare slot at arr[3], skips alloc</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Go thấy còn chỗ tại arr[3] nên ghi đè luôn</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="468" y="236" width="380" height="50" rx="6" class="gmct-step is-red" />
      <text x="480" y="257" class="gmct-red">④ L4: s1[3] reads mutated arr[3] → 99!</text>
      <text x="480" y="276" class="gmct-sm">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Side effect leaks across slice variables</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Biến s1 đổi giá trị ngoài ý muốn</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Vertical execution flow path outside step cards */}
      <line x1="864" x2="864" y1="76" y2="262" class="gmct-rail" />
      <polygon points="864,268 859,259 869,259" class="gmct-dot-red" />

      <text x="670" y="314" text-anchor="middle" class="gmct-note">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Pointer trace: L1 → L2 (shared ptr) → L3 (in-place write) → L4 (aliased read)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Luồng con trỏ: L1 → L2 (dùng chung ptr) → L3 (ghi đè tại chỗ) → L4 (đọc nhầm)</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Code-to-memory trace of slice capacity aliasing: comparing lines L1–L4 against the live heap backing array explains why s1[3] changes without any explicit write to s1.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Đối chiếu từng dòng code slice với trạng thái mảng nền trên Heap: chỉ 4 dòng từ L1 tới L4 đã làm s1[3] đổi giá trị dù không hề gán trực tiếp vào s1.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gmct { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gmct-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gmct svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gmct text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gmct-panel { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .gmct-h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gmct-line-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gmct-line-box.is-warn { stroke: var(--gold); }
  .gmct-line-box.is-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .gmct-line-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gmct-line-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gmct-step { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gmct-step.is-warn { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); }
  .gmct-step.is-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .gmct-num, .gmct-num-warn, .gmct-num-red { font-weight: 800; font-size: 11px; }
  .gmct-num { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gmct-num-warn { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .gmct-num-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .gmct-code, .gmct-code-red { font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); font-size: 11.2px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .gmct-code-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .gmct-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gmct-warn { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .gmct-red { font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gmct-ok { font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gmct-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gmct-sm { font-size: 11px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gmct-note { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gmct-wire { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .gmct-wire.is-warn { stroke: var(--gold); }
  .gmct-wire.is-red { stroke: var(--red); }
  .gmct-rail { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 3 3; opacity: 0.45; }
  .gmct-dot-warn { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .gmct-dot-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .gmct figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
